      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying, but i really just want to handle this at home. i'm pretty much fine, just a bit of a dull ache. i dont have a fever or anything. if i just use a high dose of triple antibiotic ointment and wrap it tight with some gauze, that should kill any bacteria right? like, can i just over-apply the ointment to make sure it's totally sterile? i'd rather just stay home and deal with it than sit in an urgent care waiting room for hours.",
